Package: CHIP
Type: Package
Title: Subsampling with One-Step Correction for Large-Scale Generalized Linear Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jie", "Hu", role = "aut"),
    person("Jianmin", "Chen", role = "aut"),
    person("Bingyu", "Zhang", email = "bingyuz7@sas.upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yong", "Chen", email = "ychen123@upenn.edu", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits linear, logistic and Poisson regression on very large data
    by estimating on an informative subsample and then applying a one-step
    Newton correction that uses the rest of the data. Supports uniform and
    optimal (A- or L-optimal) subsampling probabilities, and adaptive-lasso
    variable screening for high-dimensional covariates. Returns coefficients,
    sandwich standard errors and each individual's sampling probability and
    inverse-probability weight.
